title: "Locating and Enumerating Anycast: a Comparison of Two Approaches"
authors:
  - family-names: Hendriks
    given-names: Remi
  - family-names: Betzer
    given-names: Tim
  - family-names: Du
    given-names: Ben
  - family-names: Sommese
